From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Brett-Michael Green <brett@bmgvisualtech.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 16:34:34 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] spi: dt-bindings: samsung: Add the Tensor G3 SPI

zuma's (Tensor G3) SPI controllers are gs101-style, as on Tensor G4.
Document zuma's compatible with gs101's as the fallback.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Brett-Michael Green <brett@bmgvisualtech.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/samsung,spi.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/samsung,spi.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/samsung,spi.yaml
index 2cc3ba134..7feee66b2 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/samsung,spi.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/spi/samsung,spi.yaml
@@ -33,6 +33,7 @@ properties:
       - items:
           - enum:
               - google,gs201-spi
+              - google,zuma-spi
               - google,zumapro-spi
           - const: google,gs101-spi
       - const: samsung,exynos7-spi
